\f1\b Phase 10 \'97 DHT\

\f0\b0 Goal:\'a0Trackerless peer discovery. Required for magnet links.\
This is the hardest phase. Budget more time here than any other.\
Build in this sub-order:\
\pard\pardeftab560\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls19\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	0.	}Node ID generation (160-bit, persisted to disk)\
{\listtext	0.	}UDP message layer (BEP 5 uses its own bencoded UDP protocol)\
{\listtext	0.	}Routing table: k-buckets, bucket splitting, node eviction\
{\listtext	0.	}ping\'a0/\'a0find_node\'a0operations\
{\listtext	0.	}Bootstrap from\'a0router.bittorrent.com:6881\'a0and\'a0router.utorrent.com:6881\
{\listtext	0.	}get_peers\'a0\'97 find peers for an info hash\
{\listtext	0.	}announce_peer\'a0\'97 tell DHT you have a torrent\
{\listtext	0.	}Token rotation (security requirement for announces)\
